1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:04,789
The Deck. Your apps, people and tools,
one swipe in from the bar.

2
00:00:06,048 --> 00:00:10,418
Swipe in from the tab. Swipe from the
Dock toward the middle of the screen.

3
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:14,540
Out slides the Deck: your people,
your apps and your tools.

4
00:00:14,852 --> 00:00:17,862
Tap a tile. Some tiles act at once.

5
00:00:17,902 --> 00:00:21,351
Flashlight switches the torch
on, and its tile lights up.

6
00:00:21,671 --> 00:00:25,406
Or open a card. Others open
a card beside the strip.

7
00:00:25,446 --> 00:00:29,278
Volume has sliders for media,
ringtone and alarm.

8
00:00:29,612 --> 00:00:33,157
Start a timer. Tap Timer,
pick a length and Start.

9
00:00:33,197 --> 00:00:35,885
It keeps counting after the Deck closes.

10
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:40,440
Close it. Tap anywhere
outside, or press Back.

11
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,867
Left alone, it closes
itself after 10 seconds.

12
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:49,665
Open the Deck settings. In Gesture Volume,
under Advanced features, tap Deck.

13
00:00:50,779 --> 00:00:52,589
Turn tiles on or off.

14
00:00:52,629 --> 00:00:55,589
Tap Deck tiles and switch
on the ones you want.

15
00:00:55,629 --> 00:00:59,467
Coin toss and Dice start
off; Screenshot can go.

16
00:00:59,908 --> 00:01:01,443
Add people to call.

17
00:01:01,483 --> 00:01:05,018
Back on the Deck screen, Quick
dial puts people in the strip:

18
00:01:05,058 --> 00:01:07,984
one tap calls them or opens a message.

19
00:01:08,379 --> 00:01:12,064
Toss a coin. Coin toss now
waits at the end of the strip:

20
00:01:12,104 --> 00:01:15,568
scroll down to it, tap
it, then tap the coin.

21
00:01:19,283 --> 00:01:21,565
Up next: Search in the Deck.
